      "writtenOn": "2025-10-13T22:01:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a universal node only for FP builds.  For EC builds, we\u0027ve already had to delete the rollback entries to get things building correctly.  [Example](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/ocelot/ocelotrvp-ite/binman.dtsi;l\u003d13;drc\u003db262450cf1b76a62939ca2fcc874a8da201441da)\n\nIt might be time to have separate binman defaults for FP and EC builds.",
      "parentUuid": "d7068e7f_8c49a633",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 0
